{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"叠"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"叠"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>叠</strong>是"},{"Local":{"url":"景","text":"景"}},{"Plain":"上取值于"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶范畴","text":"高阶范畴"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"景上的层","text":"层"}},{"Plain":", 也即高阶"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"的对象.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>对于 Lie 群 $G$ 有一个叠 $\\mathbf{B}G$, 它是一个函子 $\\mathsf {Mfd}^{\\text{op}}\\to\\mathsf {Grpd}$, 将流形 $U$ 对应到 $U$ 上的 $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"主丛","text":"主丛"}},{"Plain":"的群胚, 将态射 $U\\to V$ 对应到主丛的拉回.</p>\n"}]}}